From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] camera-status-icon: No icon flashing up at startup

Plinius: the status icons box adds every plugin icon shown, and the
camera icon binds its revealer to the camera manager only when it gets
realized, once the top panel is mapped. The revealer then hides with
its transition, so the orange camera icon showed for a moment at every
start of Phosh although no camera ran: measured on the phone, no
camera node went to RUNNING from before Phosh started on, the camera
nodes only appeared a second before "Phosh ready".

The first state is now taken without a transition; later changes
still fade.
---
 plugins/camera-status-icon/camera-status-icon.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plugins/camera-status-icon/camera-status-icon.c b/plugins/camera-status-icon/camera-status-icon.c
index 646a554..d197f99 100644
--- a/plugins/camera-status-icon/camera-status-icon.c
+++ b/plugins/camera-status-icon/camera-status-icon.c
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@ phosh_camera_status_icon_realize (GtkWidget *widget)
 {
   PhoshCameraManager *manager = phosh_shell_get_camera_manager (phosh_shell_get_default ());
   GtkWidget *gtkrevealer, *phoshrevealer;
+  guint duration;
 
   GTK_WIDGET_CLASS (phosh_camera_status_icon_parent_class)->realize (widget);
 
@@ -32,7 +33,12 @@ phosh_camera_status_icon_realize (GtkWidget *widget)
   gtkrevealer = gtk_widget_get_parent (widget);
   phoshrevealer = gtk_widget_get_parent (gtkrevealer);
 
+  /* The status icons box adds us shown and we're realized only once the panel is mapped:
+   * take the manager's state without a transition, else the icon fades out at startup */
+  g_object_get (phoshrevealer, "transition-duration", &duration, NULL);
+  g_object_set (phoshrevealer, "transition-duration", 0, NULL);
   g_object_bind_property (manager, "in-use", phoshrevealer, "show-child", G_BINDING_SYNC_CREATE);
+  g_object_set (phoshrevealer, "transition-duration", duration, NULL);
 }
 
 
